diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index ff92be649ff3f610b38798b3310751534d032814..780d9320e92984803ed19afdd28d4ed3f71cf2fe 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,24 @@
 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
+
+## API
+
+### `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`
+
+Resolves a [JSON Pointer](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901) against a JSON document and returns
+the value it refers to. Throws a `JsonPointerError` when `pointer` is not a syntactically valid JSON
+Pointer, or when it does not resolve to a value within `document`.
+
+```ts
+import { resolvePointer } from 'json-toolkit';
+
+const document = { a: { b: ['x', 'y'] } };
+resolvePointer(document, '/a/b/1'); // 'y'
+resolvePointer(document, '');       // the whole document
+```
+
+## Development
+
+- `npm test` runs the test suite.
+- `npm run typecheck` type-checks the project.
